# Email Configuration Options
# Choose either EmailJS OR Formspree to receive form submissions directly in your inbox.

# OPTION 1: EmailJS (https://www.emailjs.com/)
# Create a free account, add an Email Service (e.g. Gmail), and create an Email Template.
VITE_EMAILJS_SERVICE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_TEMPLATE_ID=
VITE_EMAILJS_PUBLIC_KEY=

# OPTION 2: Formspree (https://formspree.io/)
# Create a form on Formspree and paste the form ID here:
VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=
